  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "The short answer",
      "items": [
        "poly-ref imports no compiler code, only erased types from core, and the import-boundary script enforces it",
        "the pipeline then requires poly-ref and polygraph to agree on counts and findings"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Not shown here",
      "items": [
        "The runtime, the ledger and the feedback commands, none of which touch the independence rule",
        "Connected but out of scope: poly CLI, poly-embed, Certified build, polygraph 8.4.0, Polyaxion, polycheck"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Constraints",
      "items": [
        "poly-ref shares no code with the compiler: a checker written from the same code would agree with its bugs; poly-ref may import only node builtins, sam-pattern and type-only imports of core"
      ]
    }
  ]
